{"5106210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tank Fu", "steam_appid": 5106210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5108100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Fu is an experimental over-the-top character action fighting game. Make your tank dash, fly, and punch its way into victory by mastering all its moves and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>*This is a pre-alpha playtest, all aspects of the game are open for change</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear me out, what if tanks started fighting using martial arts? Inspired by games like Bayonetta and Hi-Fi RUSH, we prototyped a quick character action with over 16 moves for you to master and get the best score you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scoring can be accumulative as long as you keep your streak going and use a variety of moves, so don't relly too much on just a few combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this simple pre-alpha playtest, you can play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 4-arena tutorial to learn most of the moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 5-minute arena with endless enemies to get the highest score and compete your score against other players on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 16 moves to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Both air and ground combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cinematic finisher moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leaderboards</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tank Fu is an experimental over-the-top character action fighting game. Make your tank dash, fly, and punch its way into victory by mastering all its moves and combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>*This is a pre-alpha playtest, all aspects of the game are open for change</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/6fa44355619b3f08c7f2d63fca05985b.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear me out, what if tanks started fighting using martial arts? Inspired by games like Bayonetta and Hi-Fi RUSH, we prototyped a quick character action with over 16 moves for you to master and get the best score you can get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/9f15d8bd63afc51d34f4d27f33b13bdb.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scoring can be accumulative as long as you keep your streak going and use a variety of moves, so don't relly too much on just a few combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/2b61b81846a6bfbfd8c407e8ac7bb8a3.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For this simple pre-alpha playtest, you can play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 4-arena tutorial to learn most of the moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A 5-minute arena with endless enemies to get the highest score and compete your score against other players on the leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.poster.avif?t=1787221438\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.webm?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/extras/77449de68c734ddb7412601820ef6969.mp4?t=1787221438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Over 16 moves to master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Both air and ground combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cinematic finisher moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Leaderboards</p>", "short_description": "Tank Fu is an experimental over-the-top character action fighting game. Make your tank dash, fly, and punch its way into victory by mastering all its moves and combos.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/a16c705c4f49b8f7be4109a029f25d123adcb2f0/header.jpg?t=1787221438", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/b405bf7b7eb34a8e95a9b958a0412b06c584ec1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787221438", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5106210/b405bf7b7eb34a8e95a9b958a0412b06c584ec1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787221438", "website": "https://knightowlgamesstudio.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent, Integrated cards also work<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Knight Owl Games"], "publishers": ["Knight Owl Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "cat